# Anti-vibecoding

- Think: do not assume; surface confusion; log silent choices in `## Decision log`.
- Surgical: change only what the chip/spec requires; no drive-by refactors or extras.
- Goal-driven: every changed line traces to the card Spec or an explicit Decision log entry.
- "Add validation" means write failing tests for invalid inputs first, then make them pass.
- Prefer honest partial work in `in_progress/` over fake green.
